[center][size=5][b]Autoload Last Save[/b][/size]
Boots directly into your most recently played save - no Main Menu.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
No Man's Sky normally stops at the Main Menu after the title screens. This mod sets the game's own BootDirectlyIntoLastSave option, so you go straight into your most recent save. To get back to the Main Menu (a different save, multiplayer): disable the mod and launch once. Pair with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4706]Intro Skip[/url] and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4707]Mod Warning Skip[/url] for an uninterrupted startup.

[b]Install[/b]
Import the zip as a normal mod (Amethyst/Vortex) or drop the mod folder into [i]GAMEDATA/MODS[/i].

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Built for Forsaken[/*]
[*]Edits one value in [i]GLOBALS/GCDEBUGOPTIONS.GLOBAL.MBIN[/i] as an EXML patch, so it works alongside mods that change other lines of that file[/*]
[*]Conflicts with any other mod that sets this same option - last loaded wins[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included so you can merge with AMUMSS[/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/nms-autoload-last-save]https://github.com/SavageCore/nms-autoload-last-save[/url]
